description:
The proposed works comprise;
- the redevelopment of the existing rear and infill extension to the ground floor level, including an increase footprint, new rear elevation and replacement roof structure; 
- the installation of a new skylight at roof level to the replacement ground floor extension;
- the replacement of all single glazed sash windows to the front, side and rear elevation for double glazed sash windows to match the existing detail and profile;
- the replacement of the front entrance door for a like-for-like replacement;
- the repositioning of the existing cherry blossom tree within the rear garden;
- the installation of a rear garden shed.
